---
title: How to Set Up Automated Invoice Reminders in Taskip
sidebar:
  order: 16
---
**Taskip allows you to automate email reminders for clients who have pending invoices. You can schedule reminders to be sent before or after the due date, customize the subject and message with dynamic placeholders, and control the activation of each reminder.**

*How to Set Up Automated Invoice Reminders in Taskip*

### **Steps to Configure Reminder Settings**

**1. Open Settings**\
**From the Taskip dashboard, go to the left-hand sidebar and click on Settings.**

**2. Select Invoice Settings**\
**Inside the settings panel, choose Invoice Settings from the available options.**

**3. Switch to the Reminder Tab**\
**In the Invoice Settings section, click on the Reminder tab at the top to access reminder configuration options.**

### **Configure a New Reminder**

**Send Reminder**

- **Choose whether the reminder should be sent Before Due Date or After Due Date.**
- **Set the number of days to trigger the reminder relative to the due date.**

**Reminder Email Subject**

- **Enter the subject line for the reminder email.**
- **Use dynamic placeholders to personalize it (e.g., `{{Contact_first_name}}`, `{{Invoice_subject}}`).**

**Reminder Message**

- **Write the body of the email.**
- **Use the rich text editor for formatting and include placeholders for dynamic content such as:**
  - **`{{Contact_first_name}}`**
  - **`{{Contact_last_name}}`**
  - **`{{Contact_email}}`**
  - **`{{Invoice_subject}}`**

**Enable or Disable Reminder**\
**Each reminder can be toggled on or off using the switch on the top-right of the reminder box.**

**Add Multiple Reminders**\
**Click the Add Reminder button to schedule additional reminders. You can add as many reminders as needed to follow up with clients.**

**Save Changes**\
**After configuration, click Save Changes to apply your settings.**

### **Best Practices**

- **Send at least one reminder a few days before the due date to improve on-time payments.**
- **Use the client’s name and invoice subject in the message for a more personalized tone.**
- **Enable multiple reminders at different intervals for higher effectiveness.**

## **Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)**

### **Can I send multiple reminders for the same invoice?**

**Yes. Taskip allows you to add and configure multiple reminders based on different timings (before or after the due date).**

### **Can I use dynamic fields in the email message?**

**Yes. You can insert placeholders like `{{Contact_first_name}}`, `{{Invoice_subject}}`, and others to personalize the message.**

### **Will reminders be sent automatically?**

**Yes. Once reminders are enabled and saved, Taskip will automatically send them based on the schedule you’ve set.**

### **Can I disable a specific reminder without deleting it?**

**Yes. Use the toggle switch to temporarily disable any reminder without losing its configuration.**

### **What happens if an invoice is paid before the reminder is triggered?**

**If the invoice is marked as paid before the reminder time, Taskip will not send the reminder.**

### **Can I delete a reminder permanently?**

**Yes. Use the trash bin icon next to the reminder to permanently remove it.**
